@ChatBotRAGAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5170

### Ingest a web page (returns a jobId)
POST {{ChatBotRAGAPI_HostAddress}}/api/ingestion/scrape
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "https://example.com/" }

### Upload a file (txt/csv/docx/xlsx)
POST {{ChatBotRAGAPI_HostAddress}}/api/ingestion/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="company_profile.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./testdata/company_profile.txt
--boundary--

### Job status (replace with a jobId from above)
GET {{ChatBotRAGAPI_HostAddress}}/api/ingestion/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### List ingested documents
GET {{ChatBotRAGAPI_HostAddress}}/api/documents

### Delete a document and its chunks (source = file name or URL, URL-encoded)
DELETE {{ChatBotRAGAPI_HostAddress}}/api/documents?source=company_profile.txt

### Ask a question
POST {{ChatBotRAGAPI_HostAddress}}/api/chat/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "When was the company founded?" }

### Health
GET {{ChatBotRAGAPI_HostAddress}}/health
